e嗯，给路过的人好心情就是花圃存在的理由之一。看到花圃的你今天也一定要有好心情哦！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【只是凑巧路过。】\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e啊，你今天也来看柯莎的花圃吗？\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e在丑丑的机关被挖出来以后，就再也没有坏坏隙境原体来捣乱啦。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e珍贵的异国的花，正在柯莎的精心照料下健康生长！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【异国的花还好吗？】\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e嗯，柯莎暂时还没有什么头绪。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e但是，如果能让花的叶子，长出汐藻那样的形状，说不定能在「园艺会」上，让大家大吃一惊呢！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【新的花培育顺利吗？】\"}},\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1746508221","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"